          "url": "https://ordbokene.no/bm/halveringstid"
        }
      ],
      "not_listed": [],
      "notes": "SNL defines atommasse as the mass of a single atom, usually in u, and relativ atommasse as the dimensionless isotope-averaged value given in the periodic table. The displayed values are CIAAW standard atomic weights. The bracket explanation moves to a second line so the longer label clears the table."
